# AegisGate Security Platform — URL Redirects
# ==============================================
#
# Added 2026-06-10 as part of the demo launch (Option 1: Replace).
# See SESSION-ANCHOR-2026-06-10-demo-site-live.md, Day 3.6 section.
#
# The old /demo page has been replaced by the new interactive demo at
# https://demo.aegisgatesecurity.io/ (which is the actual AegisGate
# platform running in --mode=demo with real seed data).
#
# These redirects preserve SEO equity, bookmarks, and any external links
# pointing at the old /demo page.

# /demo (with trailing slash or any subpath) → new live demo
# 301 = Moved Permanently (tells search engines the URL has changed)
# :splat captures the subpath (e.g. /demo/foo → /foo)
# /demo alone (no subpath) goes to the demo root
/demo/*      https://demo.aegisgatesecurity.io/:splat   301
/demo        https://demo.aegisgatesecurity.io/        301

# (Future redirects can be added below this line in the format:)
# /old-url    https://new-url   301
